5 Per host - per-host.scm
*************************

It is *REQUIRED* to include a ‘per-host.scm’ in the root of this
project, which is excluded from Git, and will determine certain settings
for your own machine.  Find here a reference configuration with what is
required.

     (use-modules (gnu)
                (gnu packages))

     (define sss-filesystems
         (list (file-system
                (device "/dev/nvme0n1p3")
                (mount-point "/")
                (type "ext4"))
               (file-system
                (device "/dev/nvme0n1p1")
                (mount-point "/boot/efi")
                (type "vfat"))))

     ;; or (define sss-per-host-packages '())
     (define sss-per-host-packages
       (list
        ;; AMD non-free drivers
        (specification->package "amd-microcode")
        (specification->package "amdgpu-firmware")
        ;; Games
        (specification->package "prismlauncher")
        (specification->package "steam")))



